NARR met data with WRF-LIS coupling (Noah-3.6)

This is a test case that uses:
  (a) Single CONUS domain (-106W to -92W; 34N to 42N) @ 4km resolution 
      Lambert projection
  (b) Simulation time period from 12Z 11 Jul 2015 to 12 Jul Jan 2015
  (c) MODIS geographical data
  (d) Noah-3.6 LSM with GDAS forcing and budget-bilinear Interpolation
  (e) uses the lapse-rate based elevation correction using SRTM
      elevation data
  (f) Goddard MP (opt 7) and Goddard radiation (opt 5)
